      },
      {
        "label": "B",
        "text": "Good morning!"
      },
      {
        "label": "C",
        "text": "Goodbye!"
      },
      {
        "label": "D",
        "text": "Thank you!"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "explanation": "早上见到朋友要说 “Good morning!”（早上好）。“Good night” 是晚安，“Goodbye” 是再见，“Thank you” 是谢谢。",
    "hint": "morning 是早上的意思，早上见面应该说什么？",
